<p> BORROWER   PORSCHE INTERNATIONAL FINANCING PLC</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  PORSCHE AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.875     MATURITY    16.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.09    PAY DATE    16.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.84     SPREAD	=</p>
